  "economy.todayLead": "Ngũrani cia mwĩrĩ na kĩgitĩro cia ithiĩ ya LOADOUT na rangi cia kĩgitĩro (0.6.0) nĩciuonia mũthemba wa nyongerero na indo cia kũrĩrĩria iria ũthũngũ ũcio ũrenda gũtua.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Tondũ mbeca ciayo ciendaga kũrĩha o. Geimu ĩambĩrĩria ĩthondeketwo yothe nĩ AI nĩguo ĩhote kũrĩho; athondeki arĩa marĩhagwo nĩmo mathiaga mageka wĩra wa AI, makiumagwo marĩĩtwa.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Nĩ ngũtamba kuuma mũtandao wa thĩ yothe?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Nĩ ya gũtamba ti kũrĩha?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ciũria",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Aca o rĩu. Gũtamba na andũ angĩ thĩinĩ wa LAN ĩmwe nĩkũrathiĩ rĩu (kuuma 0.2.0); gũtamba kuuma mũtandao wa thĩ yothe ndĩthondeketwo.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Kĩgeriti kĩathondeketwo igũrũ rĩa injini ya open-source ya Quake III Arena (GPL) na kĩgĩtwara meli cia Elite Dangerous ta kĩrĩa kĩamũhumbĩrie. Mũthenya wa keerĩ koodi ya geimu nĩyathiire BuB, injini mũgeni yandĩkĩtwo na Claude Code; icunjĩ cia geimu nĩciuma kĩgeriti-inĩ na ikĩgarũrwo marĩĩtwa. Mũhaka 0.3.0 nĩwaheire mĩthemba yothe 16 ya meli mĩĩrĩ mĩgeni. Gũthuthuria kwa kũrũmĩrĩra ruhusa nĩkũrorete kana koodi ĩngĩ ĩrĩ o ya kuuma kĩrĩa kĩa GPL, na kana mathondeko ma meli ma mbere marĩ hakuhĩ mũno na kĩrĩa kĩamahumbĩrie. Kũringaniria koodi na ndandĩko ya kĩgeriti kĩa GPL kwa mũchini kwaathire <0/>, na gũthuthuria kwa ategi kwa ũhaanaine ũcio kũrĩ kũrathiĩ. Kĩrĩa gĩothe kĩngĩkorwo kĩrĩ kĩa kuuma kũu nĩkĩgaandĩkwo rĩngĩ kana kĩthondekwo rĩngĩ. Nginya gũthuthuria gũthire, tũtiugaga kana igambo nĩ aca.",
  "faq.questions": "Ciũria",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Meli, mbica, kĩonereria na maũndũ mangĩ, kũringana na mbeca iria ikoragwo. <0>Ibuku rĩrĩ rũrangi-inĩ rũũ<\/0> rĩandĩkĩte kĩndũ o kĩmwe na nĩrĩgaonania kĩndũ o kĩmwe kĩrĩa kĩgarũkĩte na mũthondeki wakĩo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Meli na nyongerero nĩ cia mbango ya gwĩtwo nĩ gũtamba kana gũgũrwo. Ũrĩa meli cia kũgũrwo ciigaga ngũrani thĩinĩ wa mbaara ya mũtambi na mũtambi nĩ ũndũ ũkoragwo ũthondekwo.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ĩyo nĩyo mbango: gũtamba ti kũrĩha, na mbeca cia geimu cia kwĩyendera na indo cia kũrĩrĩria. Ndĩthondeketwo o rĩu.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Nĩ wĩra wa mũndũ o wothe wakopetwo?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Nĩ rĩ ĩgoima, na harĩ kĩ?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Nĩ icunjĩ irĩkũ andũ megũigua, na ndĩgũtaũkĩrwo atĩa?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Nĩkĩ geimu ĩthondeketwo nĩ AI ĩgateithia athondeki?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Nĩĩkaaringana na kũrĩha nĩguo ũhote?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC ya Windows. Gũtirĩ mũthenya wa kũrutwo kana kĩguũ o rĩu.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code nĩ ciĩtwa cia biashara cia Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games nĩ ciĩtwa cia biashara cia Epic Games, Inc. Blender nĩ rĩĩtwa rĩa biashara rĩa Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous nĩ ciĩtwa cia biashara cia ene ao. Marĩĩtwa mothe nĩ ma ene mao na nĩmahũthĩrĩtwo tu nĩguo matũme ndũmĩrĩre indo iria ciĩtagwo. Orion-81 ndĩrĩ na ũguni na ũmwe wa o, ndĩtũmĩtwo nĩ o, na ndĩ rĩ ĩkĩrĩrwo nĩ o.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Nĩ kĩrĩa kĩendetwo. Gũtirĩ ũguni, ũhoro wa gũtũmĩrwo kana gwĩkĩra ũrĩho.",
