  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Gũtirĩ trakers. Gũtirĩ cookies. Rũrangi rwa kũrora. Ũhoro o wothe ũgwatanĩtio na kĩbaa kĩa wĩra; gũtirĩ kĩndũ haha kĩa kũhe kana ndaahĩta.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ĩtanagĩa o rĩu",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Kĩndũ kĩmwe kĩrĩ o kĩhingũku: <0>gũthuthuria ruhusa cia kũhũthĩra<\/0> cia koodi ya geimu ĩrĩa yoimanire kĩgeriti-inĩ kĩa GPL. Kũringaniria koodi na ndandĩko ya kĩgeriti kwa mũchini kwaathire <1/>, na gũthuthuria kwa ategi kwa ũhaanaine ũcio kũrĩ kũrathiĩ.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 nĩ mũhaka ũthondeketwo wothe nĩ AI.<\/0> Koodi ya Orion-81 ciayo nĩ ya Claude Code, ĩtongoretio nĩ mũthondeki; meli, mapu, mbica cia ngoro na mĩgambo nĩciathondeketwo nĩ indo iria Claude Code yandĩkire. Thabu cia open-source iria ĩhũthĩra ciandĩkĩtwo thĩinĩ wa <1>'Itathondeketwo nĩ AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Mũthia wa rũrangi",
